            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, a Justice questioned whether the Court presumes exemptions from taxation when statutory language is ambiguous."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "a3901e090d59690756e35310107c7847d7e153b8ab504e01526c100a8098da2e",
